# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Docs subdirectories not tracked in git
docs/decisions/
docs/prompts/
docs/reports/
docs/roadmap/
docs/sessions/

# Compiled C objects and binaries
*.o
portable-c/rexxlint-portable
portable-c/tests/out.txt

.idea/
